# Branch naming

When creating or renaming git branches:

- Use `feat/`, `fix/`, or `chore/` plus a short kebab-case slug
- **No dates** in the branch name (never `2026-11-10` or similar)
- The slug must be **fewer than 3 words** (1 or 2 kebab segments after the prefix)

```text
✅ feat/os-bodega
✅ fix/login-token
❌ feat/2026-11-10-os-bodega-foly-propiedad-cliente
❌ feat/os-bodega-foly-propiedad-cliente
```
